This product includes an adaptation of requirements and concepts from the
StackStorm Exchange AWS pack, version 2.0.2, originally by StackStorm, Inc.
and subsequently maintained by StackStorm Exchange contributors.

Source: https://github.com/StackStorm-Exchange/stackstorm-aws
Revision: cc8ff4fa335229178ec24586aff4a69f9a270ecb
