The implementation, session and credential handling, action contracts, safety
guards, and Attune metadata have been substantially rewritten. None of the
upstream pack's 3,583 generated boto action metadata files were ported. Current
API behavior was reviewed against boto3 and botocore 1.43.72 service models at
revisions a3fc41f4709808012ad6053980a7a9422ed4d1a4 and
6e07fe03fd69cf36c930f8c9f7cad7f7f4fd4892 respectively.
